OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785190687
OL,3,CViral video of woman being insulted on
OL,4,CThai train prompts Italian apology
OL,6,FItaly has issued a public apology
OL,7,Fafter a group of students from the
OL,8,Fcountry was filmed insulting a Thai
OL,9,Fwoman on a train.
OL,11,FFootage of the incident on board a BTS
OL,12,FSkytrain in Bangkok prompted an angry
OL,13,Fbacklash after going viral on social
OL,14,Fmedia.
OL,16,FThe row erupted when a Thai commuter
OL,17,Fasked the students to keep their
OL,18,Fvoices down, telling them: "In
OL,19,FThailand, we don't scream."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
