PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785190687
OL,3,CViral video of woman being insulted on
OL,4,CThai train prompts Italian apology
OL,6,FA member of the group, who was in
OL,7,FThailand for a school trip, could then
OL,8,Fbe heard replying sarcastically:
OL,9,F"Sorry for bringing money to your
OL,10,Fcountry."
OL,12,FOthers were seen laughing at the woman
OL,13,Fand swearing at her, while a boy was
OL,14,Fspotted raising a middle finger.
OL,16,FThe footage sparked outrage online,
OL,17,Fleading to the Italian embassy in
OL,18,FBangkok releasing a video featuring
OL,19,Fthree adults and a teenager
OL,20,Fapologising to the Thai people on
OL,21,Fbehalf of the group.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785190687
OL,3,CViral video of woman being insulted on
OL,4,CThai train prompts Italian apology
OL,6,F"We are the leaders of the Italian
OL,7,Fgroup that went viral. We are making
OL,8,Fthis video to apologise to the Thai
OL,9,Fpeople and Thai culture," a man could
OL,10,Fbe heard saying in the clip.
OL,12,F"We wanted to ask for forgiveness for
OL,13,Four behaviour to the Thai people and
OL,14,Fthe country."
OL,16,FA woman then added: "I'm personally
OL,17,Fextremely sorry for what has happened.
OL,18,FI perfectly know that money can't buy
OL,19,Frespect and I'm really sorry for all
OL,20,Fthe people offended and for having
OL,21,Foffended Thai culture and Thai people."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785190687
OL,3,CViral video of woman being insulted on
OL,4,CThai train prompts Italian apology
OL,6,FThe boy who was filmed sticking his
OL,7,Fmiddle finger up at the woman on the
OL,8,Ftrain said sorry for his role in the
OL,9,Fincident, admitting his behaviour was
OL,10,F"wrong".
OL,12,FThe Italian embassy also posted its
OL,13,Fown apology in which it expressed its
OL,14,F"deep regret" over what had happened.
OL,16,F"The embassy extends its sincere
OL,17,Fapologies to the people of Thailand
OL,18,Fand to everyone affected by this
OL,19,Fincident," the statement read.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
