OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785190687
OL,3,CViral video of woman being insulted on
OL,4,CThai train prompts Italian apology
OL,6,F"The inappropriate behaviour of this
OL,7,Fgroup of underage tourists does not in
OL,8,Fany way represent the Italian people."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/5
